AIDOMART
COMPLETE PROJECT OVERVIEW AND DEVELOPER REQUIREMENTS
1. PROJECT OVERVIEW
AIDOMART is a multi-vendor online marketplace website designed to connect buyers with independent sellers.
The purpose of the platform is to allow buyers and sellers to register on the same website, with each user selecting the appropriate account type. Sellers should be able to establish and manage their own businesses through private dashboards, publish products and receive orders. Buyers should be able to explore products, visit seller profiles, place orders, make payments and provide feedback after purchasing.
The platform must provide a central marketplace where products published by approved sellers appear in the Shop section. Buyers should also be able to identify the sellers behind those products, view their profiles and explore other products they have published.
The administrator must maintain control over seller approval, marketplace management and other authorised administrative functions.
The objective is to develop a complete, functional and secure marketplace. This is not simply a website with attractive pages or dashboard designs. Every feature must connect to the appropriate backend functionality and database.
